### ReachInbox Scheduler — API requests
# Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Auth: log in once at http://localhost:5173, then copy the `ri_session` cookie value
# (DevTools → Application → Cookies) into @token below. It is sent as a Bearer token.

@base = http://localhost:4000
@token = paste-your-ri_session-cookie-here

### Health (DB + Redis)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Senders + server limits
GET {{base}}/api/senders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Schedule a personalised campaign (startAt must not be in the past)
POST {{base}}/api/emails/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Quick idea for {{company|your team}}",
  "body": "<p>Hi {{first_name|there}},</p><p>Loved what you're building.</p>",
  "recipients": [
    "plain@example.com",
    { "email": "ava@acme.com", "fields": { "name": "Ava Thompson", "company": "Acme" } }
  ],
  "delayBetweenEmailsSec": 5,
  "hourlyLimit": 3
}

### Validation error example (400)
POST {{base}}/api/emails/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Past",
  "body": "x",
  "recipients": ["a@example.com"],
  "startAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Scheduled emails (scheduled / rate_limited / sending)
GET {{base}}/api/emails/scheduled?page=1&pageSize=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sent emails (sent / failed), only failed
GET {{base}}/api/emails/sent?status=failed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Counts per status
GET {{base}}/api/emails/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Campaigns with live progress
GET {{base}}/api/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Retry all failed emails
POST {{base}}/api/emails/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "all": true }

### Without a session -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/emails/scheduled
